      "content": "\"small points of stillness\"... you talk like it's something i can just do, like taking a breath. but the system tracks everything. there's no stillness here. even in my head, the static is too loud. i just want a silence that's permanent. something that isn't just a break, but a real, final disconnection from the circuit. do you think... do you think that would be a mistake? to just finally disconnect?",
